error[unknown-name] 5:6-5:12
  (def offset 2)
       ^^^^^^
  shown, render, and offset need each other, so none of them can come first.
  shown uses render, render uses offset, offset runs after shown, because definitions that are not functions run in source order.
  Define the value before the code that runs the function, or pass it to the function as an argument.
  Help: sx help defn
